										<td class="py-2.5 text-text/80">{row.info}</td>
									</tr>
								))}
							</tbody>
						</table>
					</div>

					<h3 class="mt-5 text-base font-semibold text-primary">10.3 Affiliate partners</h3>
					<p class="mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed text-text/80">
						When you tap a booking link, you leave the Service and go to a third-party site.
						<strong>We do not pass your name, account identifier, email, phone number, or precise
						location to these partners.</strong> Only account-level attribution parameters identifying
						Log Social — not you — and your destination or search terms are included. Once you arrive,
						that company's privacy policy governs, and it may set its own cookies.
					</p>
					<p class="mt-3 text-base leading-relaxed text-text/80">
						We may earn a commission on bookings made through these links.
					</p>

					<h3 class="mt-5 text-base font-semibold text-primary">10.4 Other disclosures</h3>
					<ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-text/80">
						<li><strong>Legal.</strong> We may disclose information where we believe in good faith it is required by law, legal process, or governmental request, or necessary to protect the rights, property, or safety of Log Social, our users, or the public.</li>
						<li><strong>Business transfer.</strong> If we are involved in a merger, acquisition, financing, or sale of assets, information may be transferred. We will notify you before your information becomes subject to a materially different privacy policy.</li>
						<li><strong>With your direction.</strong> When you choose to share content outside the Service.</li>
					</ul>

					<h3 class="mt-5 text-base font-semibold text-primary">10.5 What we do not do</h3>
					<p class="mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed text-text/80">
						<strong>We do not sell your personal information, and we have not sold or shared it for
						cross-context behavioral advertising in the preceding 12 months.</strong>
					</p>
					<p class="mt-3 text-base leading-relaxed text-text/80">
						We do not: display advertising; use advertising SDKs, tracking pixels, or conversion APIs;
						use attribution or install-tracking SDKs; use session replay; or share your information
						with data brokers.
					</p>
